WEBVTT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.950
Police! Open up!

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.130
No!!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.630
Stop...

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.050
Kiru, Mi, Beibi.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:18.900
Morning.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.540
This is the police!

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.090
You're under arrest!

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.670
Did something new catch your interest?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.200
Put up your hands!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.580
Wow, you're actually playing along!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:36.000
Obstruction of justice...

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.740
Owie...

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.920
So what are you on about this time?

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.120
I found some toy handcuffs so I felt like playing with them.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.960
Put out your hands.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.380
You're under arrest!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.910
Did you seriously think I was going to?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.190
It's pointless to resist...

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.570
Who's being pointless here?

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.720
As an assassin do you avoid the police?

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.770
That's got nothing to do with it.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.020
Then it's fine!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.350
Just play along!

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:38.540
Why not? Why not?

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.690
C'mon c'mon c'mon c'mon c'mon!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.300
Fine, just to shut you up.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.070
Really?

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:47.660
Yep.

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.250
Why on me?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.880
Didn't you want to play?

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:57.790
Do you really think something like this can hold me down?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.080
Watch this!

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:02.580
Too hard...

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.420
Can you get the key from my pocket please?

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:11.750
Now it's your turn to test your strength!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.840
Handcuffs aren't meant for that.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.490
Come on, just one time!

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.450
I'll unlock them for you right after!

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.270
Geez...

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.420
Right after, okay?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:20.770
Yep!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.490
Hey.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.990
Now you can't use your hands!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.830
Can you take this key from me?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.160
Come and get it—

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.360
No kicks... Yours are too strong...

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.980
Shut up! Unlock these!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.720
Too easy, Sonya-chan!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.490
You always fall for my simple tricks!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.840
Huh?

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.720
Did it really hurt that much?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.650
You always fall for my simple tricks, too!

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.680
Geez.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.620
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.580
I locked us together so you can't get away!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.630
You and your stupid ideas...

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.740
I can't run!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.440
I'll forgive you this once if you undo these right now.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.240
Okay...

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:21.640
Hurry.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.780
I can't do it easily with my left hand...

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.280
It broke.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.630
How did it break so easily?!

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.780
It's just a toy!

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.680
Fine then.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:39.920
I'll break it.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.410
No way...

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.540
Give it up.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.310
Here I go!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.500
Why is this toy so tough?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.190
It's made well...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.620
They should have made the key the same!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.220
Once again!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.620
You can't! This is metal!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.830
If metal's no good then maybe flesh...

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.380
Class is about to start!

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:15.300
We can't show up like this!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.300
Come!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.260
We'll deal with it out back!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.990
Okay, no one's here.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.280
What are you doing?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.280
I'll break it with this.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.540
Don't move.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:32.600
Okay.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:38.830
Damn, it's not breaking.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.480
Fine, I'll put all of my strength into it—

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.710
You damn...

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.880
Stop running!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:49.420
No!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.140
Stop spinning!

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.220
Help me!

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.670
I feel sick...

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.080
Hey look! It came off somehow!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.310
Wow! Just like I planned!

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.930
Wait, where are you going?

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.390
Class is starting.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.410
Sonya-chan!

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.160
Wait! Sonya-chan!!

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.520
Another day.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:35.030
Hey when's your birthday, Sonya-chan?

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.330
Where did that come from?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.400
I'm not telling you.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.570
Don't you want a birthday present?

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:41.470
Not really.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:42.370
No way!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:46.700
How could you waste a day when you can legally obtain free stuff?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.750
What's wrong with you?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.380
You sure run your mouth...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.940
If you don't want your birthday, give it to me!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:52.940
How?

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:56.280
Celebrate for me instead of you on your birthday.

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:57.910
Just like that?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:05.480
Don't tell me that you don't know when your birthday is since the organization picked you up as a child?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.630
Wrong.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:09.420
Oh, so you just forgot?

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:12.980
That's no good! You should write it down!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.380
Don't just decide things like that!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.390
So warm...

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.110
The next day.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:28.560
Happy birthday!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.050
Whose?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.940
Yours, of course!

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:34.210
What? I never told you when it is.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.330
That's why I decided it's today!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.880
Why are you deciding that on your own?

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:42.770
Just be glad I didn't make it my birthday instead.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.750
And so today we're having a birthday party!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.180
There'll be presents, of course!

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.930
More pointless crap...

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.350
It's fine! Just think of it as having another birthday!

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.430
You know...

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:02.310
We'll be holding it in Agiri-san's room as usual.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.890
What a hassle. I'm not going.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:07.710
Sure about that?

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.510
If I let off all these crackers at once...

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.020
Stop! If you make a scene, they'll think I'm an idiot too!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.130
Agiri-san's coming later.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.760
She's coming too?

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:28.330
She told me to give you these presents.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.080
That is a lot of huge things.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.100
"Three make one."

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:38.320
"Unwrap and stack in order."

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.460
Apparently.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.030
Like this?

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.380
Ta da!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:45.950
Well?

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:46.820
Well what?

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:51.130
Don't worry, there are real presents for you.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.130
You didn't need to bother...

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.180
And on that note, happy birthday!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.840
Happy birthday, yay!

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:02.090
I really don't care...

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.320
"Whatever, just give me my presents."

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.950
Such an impatient person, right?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:12.780
But before that, cake comes first!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.170
Agiri-san brought it!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:21.670
I'll light them, then you can blow them out.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.590
There's no way I'm doing something that embarrassing.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.150
Aw, come on...

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.990
Yay!

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:35.060
Happy birthday! Yay!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:41.770
And here's the present you've been waiting for!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:42.780
I don't want it!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:44.370
I'll bet it's something dumb.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.030
Come on, don't be like that!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.620
A bomb?!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.090
It was just a clock...

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:01.590
What?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.770
Happy... happy...

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.440
That was mean, Sonya-chan.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.720
Sorry.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.130
Well, that was just broken junk I found in the closet anyway.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.150
That's even worse!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.800
That was just a dummy!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.860
Here's the real one.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:19.800
Here!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.730
I'll bet that's just another dummy.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:30.170
Here's my present!

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.040
Is this a... ninja outfit?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:38.180
Wow! A genuine outfit from a ninja!

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:41.080
I've never seen you wear anything like this though.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.310
Of course not.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:47.050
I bought that at a party goods store because I didn't have one.

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:50.100
That's not genuine at all!!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.590
Hey Sonya-chan, since it's your birthday, why don't you try it on?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.670
I'd love to see that!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.480
Let's go meet the cat's master—

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.020
L-Like this?

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.350
You're an assassin but you look like a ninja!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.080
You look like some western comic book stereotype!

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:22.170
"Sushi! Tempura! Geisha! Mount Fuji!"

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.810
Ow ow ow!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.020
That's just a normal submission.

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.730
I'll give this to you, so let me go!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.680
You were going to give this to me anyway.

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.270
What is this?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.090
Never seen one?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.070
You breathe it in and it makes your voice higher.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.550
Happy birthday Sonya-chan!

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:51.330
Omedetou omedetou tokyo tokkyo kyokka kyokku!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:55.820
Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled pepper!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.530
Just like that!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:00.270
Ninja technique: voice change!

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:01.760
That kinda pisses me off.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.790
And you emptied it.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:08.170
Don't worry, Sonya-chan! We have a real present!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:11.760
This isn't something weird again, is it?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.550
It's fine! Open it!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.030
A piggy bank?

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:18.160
That's pretty normal.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.380
You can collect lots of money with it!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.820
Oh that's right, my birthday's tomorrow!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:25.550
What a coincidence!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.320
I'll be waiting for your present!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.780
So that was your goal from the beginning...

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:37.900
I heard about this birthday party, so I decided to show up!

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:39.000
Huh?

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.010
I just missed them, huh...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.080
Tokyo tokkyo kyokka kyokku!

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.140
This is pretty good!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.340
Tonari no kyaku wa yoku kakikuu kyakku da.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.900
Bouzu ga byoubu ni jouzu ni bouzu no e wo kaita.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:11.110
Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled pepper!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.820
The next day.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:20.940
Happy birthday to me!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.280
I didn't get anything for you.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.480
Wh-What do you mean?!

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.090
I even told you yesterday!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.140
I don't have any money to buy you a present.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.820
That's why I gave you that piggy bank yesterday!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.510
How much did you think I'd save in a day?

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:39.030
It's actually waiting in Agiri's room for you. Go and get it.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.600
Really? Woohoo!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.520
Yay!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.060
What's this?

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.440
"Three make one."

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:53.990
"Unwrap and stack in order."

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.240
Wrong order.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.000
After school.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.530
Sonya-chan, let's go home together!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.840
I have plans.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.430
This again?

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.650
What is it? Something you can't say?

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.950
<i>H-Huh? Is it really something she can't say out loud?</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.680
I'm meeting with someone.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:29.670
Oh, is that it? You got me.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.170
So, who is it?

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.530
I don't know.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:36.580
So, is that person... never going to return home?

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:41.190
<i>I knew it! Sonya-chan has "work" to do!</i>

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.490
See ya.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.110
W-Wait up!

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.600
<i>Th-This is bad. I can't let her go!</i>

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.950
<i>This might be my chance to change her!</i>

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.810
Hey hey hey, Sonya-chan.

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.200
Wanna go eat okonomiyaki right now?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.200
I just said I had something to do.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.780
C'mon! You can skip sometimes!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:02.820
People will lose faith in you if you act like that.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:08.090
<i>I'm trying to stop you from doing something bad!</i>

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.770
<i>How could you say something so respectable?</i>

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.820
Just a minute! Just wait for a minute!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.230
I'll be right back!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.970
If she gets soda all over her clothes, she'll definitely go home!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:30.740
Here!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.970
My treat. Take it!

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.130
I dunno what you're doing, but sure.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.480
D-Drink it now!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.590
It tastes better if you drink it fresh!

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.690
It's just a soda.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.060
I'm late, so I'll see you later.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.740
You're not leaving.

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:58.400
What?

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.070
If you really want to go, you'll have to get through me...

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:08.070
...by trying to persuade me nicely!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.530
What's with you?

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:11.870
Dammit!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.410
If that's how it's gonna be, I'll just hide your shoes!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.500
Stop right there!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.590
She won't get 'em now.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:23.830
Now she can't leave.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:29.870
I figured you'd do this, so I switched my shoes with yours.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.570
Ah! My shoes!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:50.790
If that's the case, I'll just stalk her to work and stop her there.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.200
But who on Earth could her target be?

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.150
A police box?

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.490
So her target's a policeman?

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.920
A challenge to the police force?

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:05.640
Or maybe she reconsidered and decided to turn herself in?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.780
That is the right thing to do, but...

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.730
Sonya, the penalty for being an assassin is 100 years in prison.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:17.680
No way!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.900
We'll meet again in 100 years.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:28.820
Sonya-chan!

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:32.490
That's no good!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.780
Don't be so rash!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.500
Oh, so it's you?

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:42.360
That girl says you're bothering her by following her everywhere.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:45.190
Well?

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.420
It smells like camphor.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.050
Wait!

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.390
Damn. She's already caught up.

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.150
Eh? The park?

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:57.800
Is that where her target is?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.630
Wait!

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:04.120
Fix our Azuchi Castle! Then apologize to the emperor!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.980
I'm sorry!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.440
That was horrible...

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.570
The hell's that?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.060
Is she trying to catch me now?

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.070
There's no way you'd trap someone with this!

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.710
Still, I'll take the candy.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.520
I'm falling!

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.210
Sonya-chan!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.000
Just stay there.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.430
Y-You can't be...

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.030
You little...

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:46.830
How could you fall into your own trap?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.450
Whose fault is that?!

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.010
It's not going to be easy to get out of here.

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:52.730
Even though you're the one who set it up.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:57.060
There's no one around to help us even if we shout.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:02.180
In that case, let's stand in a weird pose so people can discover our fossils in the future.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.290
Shut up!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.540
Why do they have to be fossils?

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:12.630
Oh! It's that dog!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.930
I bet he came back to help us!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:16.970
You think?

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.460
Please, dog! Call for help!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.490
Stop it!

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.940
Get away!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:29.200
Don't do this!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:33.790
Oh, I know.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:37.360
If I get on your back, I might be able to get out.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.900
And when that happens, you plan to just leave me here, don't you?

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.160
That's a good idea,

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.520
but you'll be at the bottom.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.730
Then you're just going to leave me here.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.220
Guess that won't work.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:50.960
If you prostrate yourself, I'll let you out first.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.970
Really?

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.880
I beg you! Let me get on your back!

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:58.890
Idiot.

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.600
I'll send help later.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:01.590
See ya.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.890
Sonya-chan!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.810
Sonya-chan! Don't go!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:14.050
You can't! You can't just kill someone!

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:17.700
Some... Something bad might happen to you!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.120
If that happens, I...

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.700
I won't be able to play with you anymore!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.720
I can't tease you, I can't get hit by you,

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.210
I can't make weird faces with you,

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:33.120
or make pointless poses with you...

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:37.500
I won't be able to do any of that anymore!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:39.540
So...

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.150
Please, don't go!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:43.630
Sonya-chan!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.550
Sonya-chan!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.630
Lucky!

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:28.180
Ticklish.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:36.780
What about your job?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.650
Change of plans.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.660
I see.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.090
What?

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:44.440
Nothing.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.820
Oh, you have something on you.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:56.140
That's mean, Sonya-chan!
